.TH CHESS 6.SH NAMEchess \- chess against the computer.SH SYNOPSIS\fBchess\fR.SH DESCRIPTIONChess on a shaded board drawn in characters.  It asks your colour, yourname, and whether you want a long or a short game, then plays.  A move istwo squares: the square of the piece, then where it goes --\fBe2\fRand then\fBe4\fR-- two keystrokes each, with no RETURN..SH SEE ALSOfuddle, gnuchess